# CLI

Scaffold only — no library-package deps. Two phases, never mixed: **resolve** (flags + prompts) then **steps** (disk writes). The runner owns output — never Clack `tasks()`. Do not hand-edit `dist/templates/`.

Templates are not a workspace member: concrete npm ranges only (`catalog:` / `workspace:*` fail the snapshot). Snapshot script is the copy/exclude/rewrite source of truth and must run after tsup (`clean: true`).

**When changing `create`, the snapshot, or the template catalog, Read** [docs/agents/cli.md](docs/agents/cli.md). Template-folder landmines: [templates/AGENTS.md](templates/AGENTS.md).
